steady_clock CPU wall time. Work cost is a controlled busy-wait (synthetic). Logging disabled inside slices; files written after runs.
Budget checked at work boundaries only: before each item, after the previous one returned. Slice elapsed includes the check, round start/commit and drain is outside slice.

